  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 50eb (Costly) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Weapons</p>\n<p><em>Now your iron won’t hit the dirt every time you drop it.</em></p>\n<p>When the weapon is voluntarily dropped by the user, it is instead stowed without an Action. When the weapon is knocked out of the user’s hands — such as from an Aimed Shot or Critical Injury — it does not fall to the ground and remains hanging at their side. It then requires an Action to be readied before it can be drawn again.</p>\n<p>When attempting to Grab a Sling-equipped weapon from its wielder/holder, the attacker suffers a -2 penalty to their Check to do so. While installed, the weapon is no longer Concealable.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Miscellaneous &amp; Accessories).</em></p>"
